**Profile**: Origin: Lahai-Roi.

{{See Also|Void Storm}}

Wherever the Shimmer gathers, a Void Storm soon follows.
A '''Shimmer''' is an atmospheric light that typically appears before a [[Void Storm]], serving as an early warning.

It is described to be an anomaly array of violent lights that forms in the skys. It was first discovered by Roald Scientific Expedition team in the frostlands before being consumed by the Void Storm.